/E (Bitcoin's endgame is ossification, or the point where the protocol becomes effectively unchangeable. That's not a popular opinion in some developer circles, but it's the logical conclusion of what makes Bitcoin valuable. The less it can be changed, the more people can trust it and plan with it.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [34]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
